                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/5061</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Belden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-29T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 29, 1917, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 30, 11.30 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s telegram May 24, 6 p.m. They may call as armed merchant vessels.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Belden</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
